The source of the generated files of the library.

The files of this directory are written in the `.atxt` format; `atsdoc`
turns them into the source of the library (`*.sats`, `*.dats`, `*.cats`).
The steps to generate the lib code:

make -f Makefile.gen
make -f Makefile all
make -f Makefile clean

Note that the source of the generated [Makefile] is [Makefile.atxt].

The directory is named SRCGEN (the source of the generated files) to
tell it apart from the DOCUGEN directory of the same tree, which holds
the documents of the library.

###### end of [README] ######
